/T (Developed with Python and lightweight image processing, the application by passed complex AI for a more elegant method. By overlaying a white intensity scale onto the appam image \(inverse square law\), it identified and counted darker regions representing holes using fundamental analysis principles. This simple, charming implementation stayed true to the project's spirit.)
