/P 151 0 R
/E (I believe communication in the future will move away from polished feeds and back toward real presence. We are entering a time where people are exhausted by performing online. They want interactions that feel immediate, authentic, and alive again. One One is not trying to replace messaging apps or social networks. It is trying to create a new layer of communication, one where talking becomes as frictionless as thinking.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [4]
>>
