/E (The long-term vision is ambitious: a world where voice becomes ambient, instant, and always available. A world where distance disappears not because of better content, but because of better presence.At its core, One One is built on a simple belief: Sometimes the fastest way to feel close to someone is just hearing their voice. In the future, the platform aims to make these moments feel even more natural, seamless, and accessible, allowing people to stay connected without the barriers of traditional communication.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [6]
>>
