/E (The broader mission of ClaimAssist AI is to become a vital safety net for Indian society. It targets the root causes of medical bankruptcy among middle and lower-class families by making the appeal process completely accessible and cost-free. Looking ahead, the team plans to expand its local prototype into a scalable enterprise solution, to support multiple users at once while keeping operational delays low. Ultimately, ClaimAssist AI stands out as a scalable social enterprise designed to reduce financial stress, and empower millions of patients across the country.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [1]
