513 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H5
/P 156 0 R
/T (The idea for the Predictive Weather Route Planner was born during our weekend two-wheeler trips to Ponmudi. As riders, we were fully exposed to the weather, often caught off guard by sudden downpours or harsh, exhausting sunlight. One afternoon, while riding through the hairpin curves of Ponmudi, we encountered a severe and unexpected rainstorm. Although the city forecast showed clear weather, the mountain roads had become slippery and unsafe. That experience made us realise the need for weather predictions that are not just location-based, but route-specific and time- sensitive.)
/E (The idea for the Predictive Weather Route Planner was born during our weekend two-wheeler trips to Ponmudi. As riders, we were fully exposed to the weather, often caught off guard by sudden downpours or harsh, exhausting sunlight. One afternoon, while riding through the hairpin curves of Ponmudi, we encountered a severe and unexpected rainstorm. Although the city forecast showed clear weather, the mountain roads had become slippery and unsafe. That experience made us realise the need for weather predictions that are not just location-based, but route-specific and time- sensitive.)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
