515 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H5
/P 156 0 R
/T (Our primary objective is to predict weather conditions along the actual route, at the exact time a rider is expected to pass through each point. By calculating estimated arrival times at the starting point, midpoint, and destination, and matching them with future three-hour forecast intervals, the system provides timely safety alerts before the journey begins.)
/E (Our primary objective is to predict weather conditions along the actual route, at the exact time a rider is expected to pass through each point. By calculating estimated arrival times at the starting point, midpoint, and destination, and matching them with future three-hour forecast intervals, the system provides timely safety alerts before the journey begins.)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [10]
>>
