/E (At present, we are refining the initial prototype by improving geocoding debounce rates and caching forecast tokens. Looking ahead, we hope to develop this prototype further as our fourth-year final project, with future plans including migration to a robust cloud database infrastructure, integration of real-time traffic density mapping, and incorporation of machine learning models for high-resolution microclimate predictions along mountain routes.)
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
523 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 157 0 R
/E (Building the application came with its own challenges. Initially, we found that there were no simple libraries that could directly connect Leaflet Routing Machine coordinates with historical or forecast weather data. To overcome this, we developed custom JavaScript functions to calculate road midpoints and used JavaScript Sets to filter duplicate weather alerts efficiently.)
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
