/P 160 0 R
/E (The project uses Large Language Models \(LLMs\), Retrieval-Augmented Generation \(RAG\), and Agentic AI workflows to generate these personalized explanations. In simple terms, the system first searches for relevant movie information from its knowledge base and then interfaces with the advanced OpenAI Application Programming Interface to create a natural-language explanation tailored to the user's profile. This approach eliminates the common risk of "made-up" or hallucinated AI responses, ensuring that every explanation remains strictly grounded in verified movie data.)
/Pg 31 0 R
/K [6]
>>
