/T (We developed the platform as a full-stack web application featuring a highly responsive React-based user interface, a Node.js backend, and a dedicated PythonAI service. By physically separating the standard web layer from the heavy AI processing pipelines, our team ensured a smart engineering design: the platform remains incredibly fast and maintains low-latency performance even under high traffic. The project also includes Text-to-Speech \(TTS\) functionality, allowing these conversational explanations to be converted into accessible audio streams for improved user engagement.)
