654 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 166 0 R
/T (At the age of 12, my life took an unexpected turn when I was diagnosed with Type 1 Diabetes. Now, at 19, I have spent eight years learning not just how to manage it, but how to live alongside it. Type 1 Diabetes is a lifelong condition that demands constant attention, discipline, and resilience. Every day involves careful decisions about food, insulin, activity, and rest, shaping me into someone more aware, responsible, and strong.)
/E (At the age of 12, my life took an unexpected turn when I was diagnosed with Type 1 Diabetes. Now, at 19, I have spent eight years learning not just how to manage it, but how to live alongside it. Type 1 Diabetes is a lifelong condition that demands constant attention, discipline, and resilience. Every day involves careful decisions about food, insulin, activity, and rest, shaping me into someone more aware, responsible, and strong.)
/Pg 37 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
655 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 166 0 R
/T (Managing this condition requires daily insulin and continuous monitoring of glucose levels, and this is where Continuous Glucose Monitoring \(CGM\) plays a transformative role. Traditionally, people rely on finger- prick glucometers, which require checking blood sugar multiple times a day often before and after meals, sometimes up to 6-7 times daily. This process can be painful and uncomfortable, especially for   children ,   and   still  provides   only )
/E (Managing this condition requires daily insulin and continuous monitoring of glucose levels, and this is where Continuous Glucose Monitoring \(CGM\) plays a transformative role. Traditionally, people rely on finger- prick glucometers, which require checking blood sugar multiple times a day often before and after meals, sometimes up to 6-7 times daily. This process can be painful and uncomfortable, especially for   children ,   and   still  provides   only )
/Pg 37 0 R
/K [6]
>>
